uri "http://kdl.ge.com/AM-CDM-build" alias AM-CDM-build version "$Revision:$ Last modified on   $Date:$".

import "http://kdl.ge.com/AM-CDM-manufacturingProcess".

Build (note "Single additive-manufacturing action in which one or more objects are built up in layers within the process chamber during one process cycle") is a type of ManufacturingProcessStep.

mfgProcessMachine of Build only has values of type AMSystem.
mfgProcessMaterialInputs of Build only has values of type AMMaterialInput.
mfgProcessMaterialOutputs of Build only has values of type AMMaterialOutput.
processStepSpecification of Build only has values of type AMProcessStepSpecification.
processStepData of Build only has values of type AMProcessStepData.

AMMaterialInput (note "Materials that are the inputs to an AM process and become a part of the material output, including feedstock and build plate.") is a type of MaterialInputs,
	described by amMatInputFeedstockMaterial (note "Bulk raw material supplied to an AM building process.") with a single value of type MaterialStock,
	described by amMatInputQuantityOfFeedstockMaterialUsed (note "Mass of material used in solidified parts.") with a single value of type Quantity,
	described by amMatInputBuildPlate (note "Build plate as a critical materail input to an AM building process.") with a single value of type BuildPlate.

AMMaterialOutput(note "Materials that are an output of an AM process, including a build product and reclaimed feedstock.") is a type of MaterialOutputs,
	described by amMatOutputReclaimedFeedstockMaterial (note "Feedstock reclaimed upon the completion of an AM process.") with a single value of type MaterialStock,
	described by amMatOutputBuildProduct (note "Build product that includes a build plate and parts built on top of it, as the primary output from an AM process.")with a single value of type BuildProduct.

BuildProduct (note "Build plate with parts connected to it") is a class,
	described by buildProdName (note "Human readable name which designates the build product") with a single value of type string,
	described by buildProdProcessHistory (note "History that is the sum of the totality of processes of the build product.") with a single value of type ProcessHistory,
	described by buildProdBuildPlate (note "Build plate which is the foundation of the build product where parts are built on") with a single value of type BuildPlate,
	described by buildProdParts (note "Parts that are built on a build plate, as the primary components of the build product") with values of type Part.

BuildPlate (note "Material input which provides a surface upon which the building of parts is started and supported throughout the build process.") is a type of Part,
	described by buildPlateID (note "Identifier assigned to the build plate for a build") with a single value of type string,
	described by buildPlateMaterial (note "Material type of the build plate.") with a single value of type MaterialType,
	described by buildPlateMaterialGrade (note "Standard grade to which the build plate material product conforms.") with a single value of type string,
	described by buildPlateHeight (note "Height of the build plate.") with a single value of type Quantity,
	described by buildPlateWidth (note "Width of the build plate.") with a single value of type Quantity,
	described by buildPlateDepth (note "Depth of the build plate.") with a single value of type Quantity,
	described by buildPlateProcessingMethods (note "Post processing methods of the build plate, e.g., hot rolled and annealed.") with a single value of type string,
	described by buildPlateSurfaceFinish (note "Surface roughness description of the build plate.") with a single value of type string,
	described by buildPlateManufacturer (note "Build plate manufacturer, links to Organization.") with a single value of type Organization,
	described by buildPlateCertificationDate (note "Purchase/certification date of the build plate.") with a single value of type dateTime,
	described by buildPlateCertification (note "Link to the build plate certificate.") with a single value of type Document.

AMProcessStepSpecification (note "Specification for an additive manufacturing process") is a type of ManufacturingStepSpecification,
	described by amSpecBuildPlan (note "Document that describes the build specific design intent and requirements, may including plate layout, witness coupons, object quantity, position/orientation.") with values of type Document,
	described by amSpecBuildLayout (note "Document that describe the arrangement or positioning of multiple parts or objects on the build platform ") with a single value of type Document,
	described by amSpecJobFile (note "Digital and proprietary file defined by a machine vendor that contains all the necessary instructions for an AM system to fabricate one or more AM objects.") with a single value of type Document,
	described by amSpecBuildCommandData (note "Dataset that captures the specific set of instructions or commands that guide the AM system during the printing process, for example, xy2-100 commands and G-code, etc.") with a single value of type DatasetMetadata.

mfgSpecGlobalProcessParameters of AMProcessStepSpecification only has values of type BuildParameters.
mfgSpecPartSpecificProcessParameters of AMProcessStepSpecification only has values of type AMPartParameters.

BuildParameters (note "Process parameters and settings which apply to all parts in the build Process") is a type of GlobalProcessParameters,
	described by buildParamPlatformPreheatTemperature (note "Temperature setting the build platform is heated to prior to print.") with a single value of type Quantity,
	described by buildParamPlatformLevelingMethod (note "Description of the method of platform leveling procedures and tools.") with a single value of type string,
	described by buildParamPlatformZStartPosition (note "Z position of top of the build plate prior to starting a build.") with a single value of type Quantity,
	described by buildParamPlatformPreheatStrategy (note "Objective for the heating process.") with a single value of type string,
	described by buildParamPlatformPreheatProfile (note "Heating profile setting for reaching the pre-heat temperature.") with a single value of type Document,
	described by buildParamLayerThickness (note "Setting for the incremental distance between built layers.") with a single value of type Quantity,
	described by buildParamEnvironmentTemperature (note "Commanded temperature of the build chamber.") with a single value of type Quantity.

AMPartParameters (note "part specific process parameters that specifies how to fabricate an additive manufacturing part") is a type of PartSpecificProcessParameters.

AMProcessStepData (note "Dataset generated in a build Process, including in-situ monitoring data, build interruptions, build cool down duration and images captured") is a type of ProcessStepData,
	described by amDataInSituData (note "Advanced AM in-situ monitoring dataset.") with values of type AMInSituData,
 	described by amDataBuildInterruptions (note "Logs of build interruptions") with values of type BuildInterruption,
	described by amDataBuildCoolDownDuration (note "Time from build completion to cooling to 100 degrees C.") with a single value of type Quantity,
	described by amDataBuildImages (note "Images collected during a build process, usually capturing the build surface.") with values of type Document.

AMInSituData (note "Dataset generated by an in-situ monitoring system during an AM Build cycle.") is a type of DatasetMetadata,
	described by amInSituCharacteristicsType (note "Characteristics measured for an in-situ measurement, e.g., melt pool geometry, melt pool temperature, powder bed surface, exposure surface.") with a single value of type string,
	described by amInSituMeasurementType (note "Technique used for an in-situ measurement, e.g., co-axial optical camera.") with values of type string,
	described by amInSituMeasurementLocation (note "Location of what is being monitored of an in-situ measurement, e.g., build surface, coaxial melt pool area.") with values of type string,
	described by amInSituDevice (note "Device used for an in-situ measurement.") with a single value of type Sensor,
	described by amInSituMeasurementDuration (note "Time from the start of data collection to the completion of an in-situ measurement.") with a single value of type Quantity.

BuildInterruption (note "Temporary cessation of the build process during a build cycle, after which it resumes with the intent to complete it") is a class,
	described by buildInterruptStartTime (note "Time when the interruption reported by machine or operator.") with a single value of type dateTime,
	described by buildInterruptEndTime (note "Time when the process is resumed or aborted.") with a single value of type dateTime,
	described by buildInterruptLayerNumber (note "Build layer number that experienced the interruption.") with a single value of type integer,
	described by buildInterruptReason (note "Reason of the build interruption.") with a single value of type string,
	described by buildInterruptHandling (note "Methods of how the interruption is handled.") with a single value of type string.

BuildProductInput (note "Material input to a process in the form of a build product") is a type of MaterialInputs,
	described by buildProductInput (note "Build product as an input to a manufacturing process") with values of type BuildProduct.

AMPartExtraction (note "Separating or extracting an AM part or component from a build product.") is a type of ManufacturingProcessStep.

mfgProcessMachine of AMPartExtraction only has values of type PartExtractionSystem.
mfgProcessMaterialInputs of AMPartExtraction only has values of type BuildProductInput.
mfgProcessMaterialOutputs of AMPartExtraction only has values of type AMPartExtractionMaterialOutput.
processStepSpecification of AMPartExtraction only has values of type PartExtractionProcessStepSpecification.
processStepData of AMPartExtraction only has values of type PartExtractionProcessStepData.

PartExtractionProcessStepSpecification (note "Specification for part extraction from a build product") is a type of ManufacturingStepSpecification.
PartExtractionProcessStepData (note "Data recorded during a part extraction process step") is a type of ProcessStepData.

AMPartExtractionMaterialOutput (note "Material output from an AM part extraction process, including parts and a build plate") is a type of MaterialOutputs,
	described by amAMPartExtractionParts (note "Parts extracted from a build product during the extraction process") with values of type Part,
	described by amAMPartExtractionBuildPlate (note "Build plate extracted from a build product during the extraction process")  with a single value of type BuildPlate.

PowderRecycling (note "Process of collecting and processing powder materials and turning them into new ones.") is a type of ManufacturingProcessStep.

mfgProcessMaterialOutputs of PowderRecycling only has values of type MaterialStockOutput.
processStepSpecification of PowderRecycling only has values of type PowderRecycleProcessStepSpecification.

PowderRecycleProcessStepSpecification (note "Specification for powder recycling") is a type of ManufacturingStepSpecification.
